WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
We have a woman who has personally changed my life

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.020
and many others.

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.330
I'm in a long line of people who've been truly affected

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.830
by this human being.

5
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.940
A Drew Gooder through and through

6
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.920
and an elementary school teacher,

7
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.790
who I surprised earlier in the week in Dallas.

8
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.648
It's Madame Patricia Byrd is here.

9
00:00:20.648 --> 00:00:23.570
(crowd cheers)

10
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.010
Patricia, take it away.

11
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.970
Express, ask your question.

12
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.160
The floor is yours.

13
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.000 line:15%
Thank you so very much.
Welcome.

14
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.970 line:15%
It's my pleasure to be here.

15
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.940 line:15%
Little do you know, Chip and Joanna,

16
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.140 line:15%
that you are my friends

17
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.089 line:15%
in my head.

18
00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:42.390
(everyone laughs)

19
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.590
The design of my home, both interior and exterior

20
00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.913
reflects some of your design elements.

21
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.690
I have fashioned my Lawrence, my husband of 43 years,

22
00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.497
into a little Chip.

23
00:00:57.497 --> 00:00:58.964
(Joanna laughs)

24
00:00:58.964 --> 00:01:00.130
Yes!

25
00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.970
Hey, hey, hey.
You heard it, Lawrence.

26
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:06.970
In terms of when I have a vision, a desire, an idea,

27
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:11.580
he just grabs the tools and say, "let's just get after it."

28
00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.413
Let's go.

29
00:01:12.413 --> 00:01:13.958
It's demo day.

30
00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:16.460
Woo, woo, woo, woo!

31
00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.710
Thank you, thank you.

32
00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.083
Yes, we accept it.

33
00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:21.510
(crowd cheers)

34
00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.730
My question for the two of you is this,

35
00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:29.140
how do you manage with all that is your lives

36
00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:32.130
to keep each other

37
00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.760
priority on the front burner

38
00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.370
first in your lives

39
00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.790
above all else, above all others?

40
00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.090
Wow.
Yeah.

41
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.110
Wow.
That's beautiful.

42
00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:45.070
Yo, you ready to rock?

43
00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.510
That's a hard act follow right there.

44
00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:49.458
I think we should be asking you that same question.

45
00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:51.260
I know.
Forget us.

46
00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:54.390
I say, after 18 years, bottom line for us,

47
00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.380
I'll keep my portion of it simple,

48
00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:01.380
it's just, we sincerely care and appreciate one another.

49
00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:05.010
And make no mistake about it,

50
00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:09.400
if something complicated were to come between Jo and I,

51
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.020
we would give all of this up in a heartbeat

52
00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.420
to make sure that Jo and I end this race together

53
00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.910
on a porch somewhere, reminiscing about the good old days.

54
00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:19.940
Hopefully that's helpful.

55
00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.010
What do you say, Jo?

56
00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:23.730
For us, we're always going back to that foundation

57
00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.060
and saying, does it need to be reworked?

58
00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.620
Is there anything that we need to shore up a little bit,

59
00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.250
but that's like a daily thing, it's maintenance.

60
00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.040
This isn't a once a year,

61
00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.080
February 14th, let's show each other we love you.

62
00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.465
It's maintenance.

63
00:02:36.465 --> 00:02:38.310
It's just like anything that you want,

64
00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.190
you gotta work for it.

65
00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.580 line:15%
You don't just say, this is great,

66
00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.610 line:15%
and it's gonna stay great.

67
00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:43.530 line:15%
You have to work at it,

68
00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.320 line:15%
you have to push for those date nights.

69
00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.930 line:15%
You have to push for those coffee dates in the morning

70
00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.620
just by the sofa by the fireplace.

71
00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:50.870
Like whatever that is.

72
00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.380
Patricia, before you take off,

73
00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.417
I do wanna bless you with one quick thing.

74
00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:55.250
Please do.

75
00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.760
I have just felt overwhelmed by not only your presence,

76
00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.180
but just your, you know, your energy.

77
00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.210
You are just a strong, beautiful woman,

78
00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.190
and I'm so thankful that you're here today.

79
00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.060
But Jo and I would like to give you

80
00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.825
and your husband $10,000.

81
00:03:07.825 --> 00:03:09.220
And we're gonna give that to you today,

82
00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:12.432
and you can spend it like a drunken sailor

83
00:03:12.432 --> 00:03:14.510
or you can give it away

84
00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.900
or you can contribute it to some foundation,

85
00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.870
but we just wanted to bless you with that

86
00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.011
before you took off.

87
00:03:20.011 --> 00:03:20.844
God bless.

88
00:03:20.844 --> 00:03:22.255
Oh my god.

89
00:03:22.255 --> 00:03:24.222
(crowd cheers)
(crowd applauds)

90
00:03:24.222 --> 00:03:26.893
10,000, ladies and gentlemen.

91
00:03:26.893 --> 00:03:28.439
Come on, let's go!

92
00:03:28.439 --> 00:03:30.280
Oh my god, I can't believe it.

93
00:03:31.191 --> 00:03:34.358 line:15%
(upbeat bright music)

